ven-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Nordstrom</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Evidence-based practice and determinants of research use in elderly care in Sweden</article-title><source>Journal of evaluation in clinical practice</source><year>2007</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>665</fpage><lpage>673</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17683312</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-2753.2007.00807.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B32"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fink</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Thompson</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Bonnes</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Overcoming barriers and promoting the use of research in practice</article-title><source>The Journal of nursing administration</source><year>2005</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>121</fpage><lpage>129</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15761309</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B33"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Polit</surname><given-names>DF</given-names><suffix>Hungler, B.P.</suffix></name></person-group><source>Nursing Research Principles and Methods. 6th edi.</source><year>1999</year><edition>6th</edition><publisher-name>Phlidalphia, PA , Lippincott</publisher-name><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10482253</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B34"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>National Board of Health and Welfare</collab></person-group><source>Kompetensf&#x000f6;rs&#x000f6;rjning inom kommunernas v&#x000e5;rd och omsorg om &#x000e4;ldre. L&#x000e4;gesrapport 2006. (Manpower Supply in elderly care in 2006). (In Swedish).</source><year>2007</year><publisher-name>Stockholm </publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>